<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Application for I-20</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .university-logo {
    /* Placeholder for logo area */
  }
  .office-info {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }
  .form-row label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 2px 0;
    min-width: 150px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .radio-group label {
    margin-right: 15px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    margin-right: 15px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .table-container {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .table-container th, .table-container td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .table-container th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="university-logo">
      <!-- University Logo Placeholder -->
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">STOCKTON UNIVERSITY</h1>
      <p style="margin: 0;">101 Vera King Ferris Drive | Galloway NJ 08205-9441</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">stockton.edu</p>
    </div>
    <div class="office-info">
      <p>Office of Graduate Studies</p>
      <p>P: {{ office_phone }} | F: {{ office_fax }}</p>
      <p>{{ office_email }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Application for I-20</h2>

  <p>In order for Stockton University to issue a Certificate of Eligibility for Nonimmigrant F-1 Student Status (Form I-20), the applicant and sponsor(s) must read and follow the instructions below accurately. Stockton University is required by the Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS) to collect evidence that the applicant will have sufficient funds while studying in the U.S.</p>

  <p>Please submit the Application for I-20 and provide the required financial support documents:</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Application for I-20</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Sponsor's Affidavit of Support</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Financial support documents</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Proof of income/employment</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Copy of passport biographical page</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Sponsor's Affidavit for Room and Board (if applicable)</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">If you are already in the U.S with a valid F-1 visa, please also provide the following:</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> All previous I-20 forms</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Copy of your most recent US visa</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> I-94 form, visit <span data-field="i94_link">{{ i94_link }}</span> and print it online</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> OPT Employment Authorization Document I-765 (if applicable)</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Change of Status Approval (if applicable)</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Student's Name (as it appears on passport)</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Family/Last:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Given/First:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_first_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Middle (if applicable):</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_middle_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Stockton ID# (if applicable):</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_id }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Email:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_email }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Phone (foreign):</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_phone_foreign }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Phone (US):</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_phone_us }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Date of birth:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_dob }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="radio-group">
        <label><input type="radio" name="gender" value="Male"> Male</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="gender" value="Female"> Female</label>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Marital status:</label>
        <div class="radio-group">
          <label><input type="radio" name="marital_status" value="Single"> Single</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="marital_status" value="Married"> Married</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>City/Country of birth:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_birth_city }} / {{ student_birth_country }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Country of citizenship:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_citizenship_country }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Foreign Permanent Address (Required)</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Number and street:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ foreign_address_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>City:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ foreign_address_city }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>State/Province:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ foreign_address_state }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Postal code:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ foreign_address_zip }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Country:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ foreign_address_country }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">US Address (if applicable)</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Number and street:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ us_address_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>City:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ us_address_city }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>State:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ us_address_state }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>ZIP code:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ us_address_zip }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Visa Status</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Are you currently in the U.S.?</label>
        <div class="radio-group">
          <label><input type="radio" name="in_us" value="Yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="in_us" value="No"> No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>If yes, what is your immigration status/type of visa?</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ current_visa_status }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>If you are currently in the U.S., please select:</p>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> I will leave the U.S. and apply for an F-1 visa in my home country, then re-enter the U.S. before the semester begins.</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> I will apply for a change of status to F-1 within the U.S.</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> I will transfer my F-1 status to Stockton University.</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Housing Options</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Will you be living:</label>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox"> on-campus</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> off-campus (renting)</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> with a family/member/friend</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Academic Information</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Level of Studies:</label>
        <div class="radio-group">
          <label><input type="radio" name="level" value="Master's"> Master's</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="level" value="Doctoral"> Doctoral</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Program/Major:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ program_major }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Concentration (if applicable):</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ concentration }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>How would you like to receive your I-20?</label>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox"> By Mail</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> Pick up by a</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> family member</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> friend</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> other</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">I hereby authorize the following individual to make inquiry and/or receive my I-20 on my behalf during the application process.</p>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Name of individual:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ authorized_person_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Contact info(phone/email):</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ authorized_person_contact }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-line">
      <div>
        <label>Student's name (Print):</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ student_name_print }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Date:</label>
        <span class="input-field">{{ application_date }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Application for I-20, Cont.</h2>

  <p>Do you have a spouse or child(ren) who will accompany you to the U.S.?</p>
  <div class="radio-group" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="radio" name="dependents_have" value="Yes"> Yes</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="dependents_have" value="No"> No</label>
  </div>

  <p>I intend to have a total of <span data-field="total_dependents_count">{{ total_dependents_count }}</span> (number) dependents with me in the U.S.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Dependent(s) Information</h3>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Family/Last</th>
        <th>Given/First</th>
        <th>Date of birth (mm/dd/yyyy)</th>
        <th>Country of citizenship</th>
        <th>Relationship</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for dependent in dependents %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].last_name">{{ dependent.last_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].first_name">{{ dependent.first_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].dob">{{ dependent.dob }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].citizenship">{{ dependent.citizenship }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].relationship">{{ dependent.relationship }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Cost of Attendance:</h3>
  <p>Below is the estimated cost of attendance for international students per academic year (Academic Year 2017-18). The total amounts are subject to change annually.</p>

  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 60%;"></th>
        <th>Graduate</th>
        <th>Graduate Doctoral</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Direct costs</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_direct_graduate">{{ cost_direct_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_direct_doctoral">{{ cost_direct_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Undergraduate Flat Rate Tuition: 12-20 credits x 2 semesters</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_tuition_ug_graduate">{{ cost_tuition_ug_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_tuition_ug_doctoral">{{ cost_tuition_ug_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Graduate Tuition: 9 credits x 2 semesters</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_tuition_grad_graduate">{{ cost_tuition_grad_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_tuition_grad_doctoral">{{ cost_tuition_grad_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Educational & General Fee Rate</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_fee_graduate">{{ cost_fee_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_fee_doctoral">{{ cost_fee_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Facilities Fee Rate</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_facilities_graduate">{{ cost_facilities_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_facilities_doctoral">{{ cost_facilities_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;">Subtotal</td>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;"><span data-field="subtotal_graduate">{{ subtotal_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;"><span data-field="subtotal_doctoral">{{ subtotal_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Other estimated costs</td>
        <td>-</td>
        <td>-</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>*On-campus Housing 1 (4 people apt.)</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_housing_oncampus_graduate">{{ cost_housing_oncampus_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_housing_oncampus_doctoral">{{ cost_housing_oncampus_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>*Meal Plan (19 meals/week)</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_meals_graduate">{{ cost_meals_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_meals_doctoral">{{ cost_meals_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Off-Campus Housing & Board</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_housing_offcampus_graduate">{{ cost_housing_offcampus_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_housing_offcampus_doctoral">{{ cost_housing_offcampus_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Transportation</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_transportation_graduate">{{ cost_transportation_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_transportation_doctoral">{{ cost_transportation_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Personal Expenses</td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_personal_expenses_graduate">{{ cost_personal_expenses_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="cost_personal_expenses_doctoral">{{ cost_personal_expenses_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;">Estimated Total:</td>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;"><span data-field="estimated_total_graduate">{{ estimated_total_graduate }}</span></td>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;"><span data-field="estimated_total_doctoral">{{ estimated_total_doctoral }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">*On-campus Housing and Meal Plan cost may be exempt by submitting a notarized Sponsor's Affidavit of Room and Board.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Visual Art programs students will need to provide additional fund of <span data-field="visual_art_fund_amount">{{ visual_art_fund_amount }}</span> per year for their art supplies.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you plan to bring your spouse and/or children under the age of 21, they will need to apply for their F-2 visas as your dependents. Additional financial support must be provided for each dependent. Spouse <span data-field="spouse_financial_requirement">{{ spouse_financial_requirement }}</span> per year, for each child <span data-field="child_financial_requirement">{{ child_financial_requirement }}</span> per year. Copy of dependent(s) passport biographical page, copy of marriage certificate, and/or copy of birth certificate must be provided.</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>